[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0000","text":"现场监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0010","text":"这就是，升降台……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0020","text":"──────…………咦？\n美琴小姐呢…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0030","text":"────……？\n为什么，会在那种地方，做铅笔转──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0040","text":"────旋转……好漂亮……\n……在那么窄的地方……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0043","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0050","text":"在那么窄的地方————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0060","text":"不是吧，难道说美琴小姐想…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0070","text":"那我放咯～\n七草小──姐，请上车～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0080","text":"啊，好，好的…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0090","text":"怎么可能…………\n在那种地方转的话…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0100","text":"……果然她打算干……\n因为美琴小姐，为了舞台的话────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0110","text":"那个，不好意思，有人────\n────哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0120","text":"那个，不好意思，美琴小姐打算在升降台上转──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0130","text":"完了，那边已经升上去了————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0140","text":"美、美琴小姐…………！\n不、不行────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0150","text":"不行，看不到……\n必须阻止她必须阻止她必须阻止她──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0160","text":"感觉会是一场很棒的演出"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0170","text":"────好，转吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0180","text":"１……１、２────────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0190","text":"日、日花……？\n日花──────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_05_0200","text":"…………\n日花酱──────？"}]
